    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/5e97f03334d177334d04fe1d9c41d371.poster.avif?t=1750195584\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/5e97f03334d177334d04fe1d9c41d371.webm?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/5e97f03334d177334d04fe1d9c41d371.mp4?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Humanity On The Brink</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As famine, flames and  Kaiju ravage the Earth,  a small bastion of Humanity holds out on the north pole.\u00a0 Or at least they did until the Kaiju came for them, too.\u00a0 Now on a perilous journey, the last of the Scorchwalkers plots it's path from the smoldering ruins of the north, across a fire-torn planet Earth, to the fabled Meadowlands of the south.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Your Brigade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scorchwalkers are advanced mechas  piloted by whole brigades of the scrappy, the hardened, and the ones with nothing left to lose.\u00a0 On your journey you'll have chances to save various comrades with unique Brigade abilities and roles to help you in combat and in navigating the harsh choices of your perilous journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deckbuilding and Mech Piloting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically build your deck to handle short term and long term challenges, until your Scorchwalker is powerful enough to break the very fabric of grid based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/b525e6e30ae5a9f42144e700662056dd.poster.avif?t=1750195584\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/b525e6e30ae5a9f42144e700662056dd.webm?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/b525e6e30ae5a9f42144e700662056dd.mp4?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid Based Terraforming and Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What better way to fight back against raging fires than with meadows, forests, and marshes\u00a0bio-engineered to deal damage to Kaiju and protect your mech!\u00a0 Watch the battlefield grow and evolve as you fight to reclaim land from Kaiju and fires alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a <strong>three headed smog monster</strong>, a <strong>gargantuan tortoise</strong> encased in flame, or a <strong>crystalline creature from outer space</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/6a132470183a4a7baa440db7370ee58c.poster.avif?t=1750195584\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/6a132470183a4a7baa440db7370ee58c.webm?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/6a132470183a4a7baa440db7370ee58c.mp4?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cycle, Doomed to Repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This challenging journey is one that few would survive, and even survival doesn't guarantee a permanent escape.\u00a0 Every run is unique as locations, combats, rewards, and the paths to the Meadowlands are randomly generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/5e97f03334d177334d04fe1d9c41d371.poster.avif?t=1750195584\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/5e97f03334d177334d04fe1d9c41d371.webm?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/5e97f03334d177334d04fe1d9c41d371.mp4?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Humanity On The Brink</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As famine, flames and  Kaiju ravage the Earth,  a small bastion of Humanity holds out on the north pole.\u00a0 Or at least they did until the Kaiju came for them, too.\u00a0 Now on a perilous journey, the last of the Scorchwalkers plots it's path from the smoldering ruins of the north, across a fire-torn planet Earth, to the fabled Meadowlands of the south.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Your Brigade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scorchwalkers are advanced mechas  piloted by whole brigades of the scrappy, the hardened, and the ones with nothing left to lose.\u00a0 On your journey you'll have chances to save various comrades with unique Brigade abilities and roles to help you in combat and in navigating the harsh choices of your perilous journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deckbuilding and Mech Piloting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically build your deck to handle short term and long term challenges, until your Scorchwalker is powerful enough to break the very fabric of grid based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/b525e6e30ae5a9f42144e700662056dd.poster.avif?t=1750195584\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/b525e6e30ae5a9f42144e700662056dd.webm?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/b525e6e30ae5a9f42144e700662056dd.mp4?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid Based Terraforming and Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What better way to fight back against raging fires than with meadows, forests, and marshes\u00a0bio-engineered to deal damage to Kaiju and protect your mech!\u00a0 Watch the battlefield grow and evolve as you fight to reclaim land from Kaiju and fires alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a <strong>three headed smog monster</strong>, a <strong>gargantuan tortoise</strong> encased in flame, or a <strong>crystalline creature from outer space</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/6a132470183a4a7baa440db7370ee58c.poster.avif?t=1750195584\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/6a132470183a4a7baa440db7370ee58c.webm?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779040/extras/6a132470183a4a7baa440db7370ee58c.mp4?t=1750195584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cycle, Doomed to Repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This challenging journey is one that few would survive, and even survival doesn't guarantee a permanent escape.\u00a0 Every run is unique as locations, combats, rewards, and the paths to the Meadowlands are randomly generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Pilot your own Scorchwalker in this deck-building roguelite adventure! Choose your own destiny as you pick which comrades to save, which cards to craft, which Kaijus to battle, and ultimately, which path to take.",
